  "title": "DIAGRAM CATEGORIES FOR Uq-TILTING MODULES AT ROOTS OF UNITY",
  "authors_raw": "HENNING HAAHR ANDERSEN AND DANIEL TUBBENHAUER",
  "title_lines": [
   "DIAGRAM CATEGORIES FOR Uq-TILTING MODULES AT ROOTS OF UNITY"
  ],
  "abstract": "We give a diagrammatic presentation of the category of Uq(sl2)-tilting modules T for q being a root of unity and introduce a grading on T. This grading is a \u201croot of unity phenomenon\u201d and might lead to new insights about link and3-manifold invariants deduced fromT. We also give a diagrammatic category for the (graded) projective endofunctors on T, indicate how our results could generalize and collect some \u201cwell-known\u201d facts to give a reasonably self-contained exposition.",
